+var spriteObservedHook*: proc(label: string): bool = nil
+  ## Installed by a HEADLESS host — the local simulator — to say which sprite
+  ## labels its policy can actually read. Nil by default, so a hosted server,
+  ## a replay and every test emit exactly what they always did: this whole
+  ## mechanism is inert until something opts in.
